    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The king has exiled his brother for treason (or so we are told). You are an army General returning from a long trip, tasked with defending the kings city against his brothers attacks. In this min-max resource management tower defense, you will die...Eventually. There is no end to the eternal waves of attacks and no breaks between waves. Can you survive the human extinction era and reach the leaderboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Min-max resources and upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Min-max the resource systems and discover the fastest, most efficient resource upgrade path. Efficiently transition to new resource systems as they unlock through the human eras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/78610f69d8f33b5d6a6984700e613c71.poster.avif?t=1754852382\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/78610f69d8f33b5d6a6984700e613c71.webm?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/78610f69d8f33b5d6a6984700e613c71.mp4?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never-ending assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wave timers, no breaks between waves - the armies keep on coming, and they will never stop until they take back the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/5e7bc0c945a88678465eaf3aff9aa17e.poster.avif?t=1754852382\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/5e7bc0c945a88678465eaf3aff9aa17e.webm?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/5e7bc0c945a88678465eaf3aff9aa17e.mp4?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your spells wisely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your spells to compliment your towers, keep up with the waves, or boost your income. Feeling behind? Use your panic spells to buy some time and a chance to catch up, but be careful as they are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/3b7355a840e93327bfe0f89bd3d5f999.poster.avif?t=1754852382\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/3b7355a840e93327bfe0f89bd3d5f999.webm?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491520/extras/3b7355a840e93327bfe0f89bd3d5f999.mp4?t=1754852382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >** Generative AI was not used in the making or any promotion of Eternal Siege</p>",
